{% block content %}<div class="election-guide">
<p>Independent public-information guide for the Township of Sables-Spanish Rivers, including Massey, Webbwood, Walford and the rural township. Election day is <strong>October 26, 2026</strong>. Online voting is open and closes at <strong>8 pm Eastern</strong> that day. <a href="https://www.sables-spanish.ca/2026-municipal-elections/">Township election page</a>; <a href="https://www.sables-spanish.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/VOTE-ONLINE-Information-Flyer-2026.pdf">Township voting information flyer</a>.</p>
<p><strong>Research checked October 19, 2026.</strong> The official list contains two candidates for mayor and thirteen for councillor. Current platforms are the main gap. This guide makes no endorsement. A missing profile answer means information is still being gathered, not that a candidate has no position or declined to answer. <a href="https://www.sables-spanish.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Official-Candidates-List-2026.png">certified candidate list, August 24</a>.</p>
